---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import logo from '../assets/logo.webp';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-16 bg-foreground py-12 text-background">
	<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[var(--container-page)] px-4 md:px-8">
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
			<div>
				<Image src={logo} alt="Irenes" format="webp" quality="mid" width={192} height={192} class="mb-3 h-24 w-24 brightness-0 invert" />
				<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-background/80">
					O nome <em>Irene</em> significa Paz. Em irenes.com.br, celebramos a arte de viver bem e em harmonia, cuidando de você e do ambiente que te cerca.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h4 class="mb-3 font-serif text-sm font-bold">Links</h4>
				<ul class="flex flex-col gap-2">
					<li><a class="rounded text-sm text-background/80 transition-colors hover:text-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-background/50" href="/">Home</a></li>
					<li><a class="rounded text-sm text-background/80 transition-colors hover:text-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-background/50" href="/categorias/">Categorias</a></li>
					<li><a class="rounded text-sm text-background/80 transition-colors hover:text-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-background/50" href="/sobre/">Sobre Nós</a></li>
					<li><a class="rounded text-sm text-background/80 transition-colors hover:text-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-background/50" href="/contato/">Contato</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h4 class="mb-3 font-serif text-sm font-bold">Categorias</h4>
				<ul class="flex flex-col gap-2">
					<li><a class="rounded text-sm text-background/80 transition-colors hover:text-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-background/50" href="/categoria/beleza/">Beleza</a></li>
					<li><a class="rounded text-sm text-background/80 transition-colors hover:text-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-background/50" href="/categoria/casa/">Casa</a></li>
					<li><a class="rounded text-sm text-background/80 transition-colors hover:text-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-background/50" href="/categoria/decoracao/">Decoração</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h4 class="mb-3 font-serif text-sm font-bold">Contato</h4>
				<p class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-background/80">
					<svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
						<rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"></rect>
						<path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path>
					</svg>
					contato@irenes.com.br
				</p>
				<p class="mb-2 text-sm text-background/80">Siga-nos</p>
				<ul class="flex gap-2">
					<li>
						<a class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-background/10 text-background/80 transition-all hover:bg-primary hover:text-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-background/50" href="https://www.facebook.com/irenes" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Facebook do Irenes">
							<svg class="h-4 w-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 2h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3z"></path></svg>
						</a>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-background/10 text-background/80 transition-all hover:bg-primary hover:text-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-background/50" href="https://www.instagram.com/irenes" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram do Irenes">
							<svg class="h-4 w-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="20" x="2" y="2" rx="5" ry="5"></rect><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"></path><line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5"></line></svg>
						</a>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-background/10 text-background/80 transition-all hover:bg-primary hover:text-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-background/50" href="https://www.youtube.com/@irenes" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="YouTube do Irenes">
							<svg class="h-4 w-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 17a24.12 24.12 0 0 1 0-10 2 2 0 0 1 1.4-1.4 49.56 49.56 0 0 1 16.2 0A2 2 0 0 1 21.5 7a24.12 24.12 0 0 1 0 10 2 2 0 0 1-1.4 1.4 49.55 49.55 0 0 1-16.2 0A2 2 0 0 1 2.5 17"></path><path d="m10 15 5-3-5-3z"></path></svg>
						</a>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-background/10 text-background/80 transition-all hover:bg-primary hover:text-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-background/50" href="https://twitter.com/irenes" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Twitter do Irenes">
							<svg class="h-4 w-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z"></path></svg>
						</a>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-2 border-t border-background/10 pt-6 sm:flex-row">
			<p class="text-xs text-background/80">© {year} irenes.com.br — Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
			<ul class="flex gap-4 text-xs">
				<li><a class="rounded text-background/80 hover:text-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-background/50" href="/politica-de-privacidade/">Política de Privacidade</a></li>
				<li><a class="rounded text-background/80 hover:text-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-background/50" href="/termos-de-servico/">Termos de Serviço</a></li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>
